     environments are propagated.  If the _locals_ dictionary is
     omitted it defaults to the _globals_ dictionary.  If both
     dictionaries are omitted, the expression is executed in the
     environment where *note eval: f4. is called.  The return value is
     the result of the evaluated expression. Syntax errors are reported
     as exceptions.  Example:

         >>> x = 1
         >>> print eval('x+1')
