     overridden in a *note tzinfo: 84d. subclass to affect the result
     returned by *note astimezone: 889.  Ignoring error cases, *note
     astimezone: 889. acts like:

         def astimezone(self, tz):
             if self.tzinfo is tz:
                 return self
             # Convert self to UTC, and attach the new time zone object.
             utc = (self - self.utcoffset()).replace(tzinfo=tz)
