5.9 Numeric and Mathematical Modules
====================================

The modules described in this chapter provide numeric and math-related
functions and data types. The *note numbers: 76. module defines an
abstract hierarchy of numeric types. The *note math: 86. and *note
cmath: a8. modules contain various mathematical functions for
floating-point and complex numbers. For users more interested in
decimal accuracy than in speed, the *note decimal: 1d. module supports
exact representations of decimal numbers.

