5.10.4 `statvfs' -- Constants used with `os.statvfs()'
------------------------------------------------------

Deprecated since version 2.6: The *note statvfs: 110. module has been
deprecated for removal in Python 3.0.

  The *note statvfs: 110. module defines constants so interpreting the
result if *note os statvfs: bc9, which returns a tuple, can be made
without remembering "magic numbers."  Each of the constants defined in
this module is the _index_ of the entry in the tuple returned by *note
os statvfs: bc9. that contains the specified information.

 -- Data: statvfs.F_BSIZE
     Preferred file system block size.

 -- Data: statvfs.F_FRSIZE
