5.12.3 `bz2' -- Compression compatible with *bzip2*
---------------------------------------------------

New in version 2.3.

  This module provides a comprehensive interface for the bz2
compression library.  It implements a complete file interface, one-shot
(de)compression functions, and types for sequential (de)compression.

  For other archive formats, see the *note gzip: 262, *note zipfile:
f1, and *note tarfile: e0. modules.

  Here is a summary of the features offered by the bz2 module:

   * *note BZ2File: ce6. class implements a complete file interface,
     including *note readline: ce7, *note readlines: ce8, *note
     writelines: ce9, *note seek: cea, etc;

   * *note BZ2File: ce6. class implements emulated *note seek: cea.
     support;

   * *note BZ2File: ce6. class implements universal newline support;

   * *note BZ2File: ce6. class offers an optimized line iteration using
     the readahead algorithm borrowed from file objects;

   * Sequential (de)compression supported by *note BZ2Compressor: ceb.
     and *note BZ2Decompressor: cec. classes;

   * One-shot (de)compression supported by *note compress: ced. and
     *note decompress: cee.  functions;

   * Thread safety uses individual locking mechanism.

