5.17.1 `subprocess' -- Subprocess management
--------------------------------------------

New in version 2.4.

  The *note subprocess: c5. module allows you to spawn new processes,
connect to their input/output/error pipes, and obtain their return
codes.  This module intends to replace several other, older modules and
functions, such as:

    os.system
    os.spawn*
    os.popen*
    popen2.*
    commands.*

Information about how the *note subprocess: c5. module can be used to
replace these modules and functions can be found in the following
sections.

  PEP 324 (http://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0324) - PEP proposing the
subprocess module

