F flag                   F flag
R flag                   A flag
S flag                   R flag
T flag                   D flag

  When a *note MaildirMessage: 1575. instance is created based upon an
*note MHMessage: 1595. instance, the following conversions take place:

Resulting state                     *note MHMessage: 1595. state
------------------------------------------------------------------- 
"cur" subdirectory                  "unseen" sequence
"cur" subdirectory and S flag       no "unseen" sequence
F flag                              "flagged" sequence
R flag                              "replied" sequence

  When a *note MaildirMessage: 1575. instance is created based upon a
*note BabylMessage: 15aa. instance, the following conversions take
place:

Resulting state                     *note BabylMessage: 15aa. state
------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
"cur" subdirectory                  "unseen" label
"cur" subdirectory and S flag       no "unseen" label
P flag                              "forwarded" or "resent" label
R flag                              "answered" label
T flag                              "deleted" label


