...........................

Wave_write objects, as returned by *note open: 1c61, have the following
methods:

 -- Method: Wave_write.close ()
     Make sure _nframes_ is correct, and close the file. This method is
     called upon deletion.

 -- Method: Wave_write.setnchannels (n)
     Set the number of channels.

 -- Method: Wave_write.setsampwidth (n)
     Set the sample width to _n_ bytes.

 -- Method: Wave_write.setframerate (n)
