     (http://tix.sourceforge.net/dist/current/man/html/TixCmd/tixComboBox.htm)widget
     is similar to the combo box control in MS Windows. The user can
     select a choice by either typing in the entry subwdget or
     selecting from the listbox subwidget.

 -- Class: Tix.Control
     The Control
     (http://tix.sourceforge.net/dist/current/man/html/TixCmd/tixControl.htm)widget
     is also known as the `SpinBox' widget. The user can adjust the
     value by pressing the two arrow buttons or by entering the value
