     (http://tix.sourceforge.net/dist/current/man/html/TixCmd/tixPopupMenu.htm)widget
     can be used as a replacement of the `tk_popup' command. The
     advantage of the *note Tix: 272. *note PopupMenu: 1d96. widget is
