5.26.7.5 Filters
................

These options may be repeated multiple times.

  `--ignore-module=<mod>'

     Accepts comma separated list of module names. Ignore each of the
     named modules and its submodules (if it is a package).

  `--ignore-dir=<dir>'

     Ignore all modules and packages in the named directory and
     subdirectories (multiple directories can be joined by
     `os.pathsep').


